191
00:06:45,886 --> 00:06:48,147
The next day, Pakistan hit back.

192
00:06:48,490 --> 00:06:49,697
In the air battle that followed,

193
00:06:50,186 --> 00:06:51,925
an Indian fighter was shot down and its

194
00:06:51,936 --> 00:06:52,349
pilot,

195
00:06:52,871 --> 00:06:55,044
Wing Commander Abhinandan Varthaman, was

196
00:06:55,055 --> 00:06:55,534
