197
00:06:55,871 --> 00:06:57,468
He was handed back two days later.

198
00:06:58,534 --> 00:07:00,675
For the second time, an attack blamed on

199
00:07:00,686 --> 00:07:02,295
the group Azhar founded had pulled two

200
00:07:02,306 --> 00:07:04,164
nuclear powers into open conflict.

201
00:07:05,162 --> 00:07:06,988
At the United Nations, India had spent a

202
00:07:06,999 --> 00:07:09,021
decade trying to list Azhar as a global

203
00:07:09,032 --> 00:07:09,608
terrorist.

204
00:07:09,956 --> 00:07:11,956
China blocked the move again and again.

205
00:07:12,303 --> 00:07:15,238
On May 1, 2019, it finally stepped aside.

206
00:07:16,331 --> 00:07:18,505
The listing came almost twenty years after

207
00:07:18,516 --> 00:07:19,081
the runway.

208
00:07:20,231 --> 00:07:22,036
The butterfly effect comes from weather

209
00:07:22,046 --> 00:07:22,579
science.

210
00:07:22,901 --> 00:07:25,172
A tiny change in one place can grow, over

211
00:07:25,183 --> 00:07:26,944
time, into a storm somewhere else.

212
00:07:27,926 --> 00:07:29,774
In security, it works the same way — only

213
00:07:29,785 --> 00:07:31,078
