216
00:07:35,307 --> 00:07:36,133
fought to free them.

217
00:07:37,179 --> 00:07:38,299
A group was founded.

218
00:07:38,636 --> 00:07:40,951
A parliament was attacked, and two armies

219
00:07:40,962 --> 00:07:41,701
