227
00:07:53,942 --> 00:07:55,899
But each of them runs back, through at

228
00:07:55,909 --> 00:07:57,812
least one of those three men, to the same

229
00:07:57,823 --> 00:07:58,518
seven days.

230
00:07:59,687 --> 00:08:02,046
The passengers of IC-814 came home.

231
00:08:02,394 --> 00:08:04,166
For most of them, the nightmare ended on

232
00:08:04,176 --> 00:08:04,970
New Year's Eve.

233
00:08:06,032 --> 00:08:07,847
The three men who were traded for them did

234
00:08:07,858 --> 00:08:08,673
not disappear.

235
00:08:09,682 --> 00:08:11,530
Whether India had a better choice in those

236
00:08:11,541 --> 00:08:13,052
seven days is still argued.

237
00:08:13,421 --> 00:08:15,780
With a plane full of hostages, a Taliban

238
00:08:15,791 --> 00:08:18,236
runway and little time, every option had a

239
00:08:18,247 --> 00:08:18,725
price.

240
00:08:19,073 --> 00:08:21,128
What is not argued is what that choice set

241
00:08:21,138 --> 00:08:21,725
